        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a triangle in a hand-drawn world. Roll around and encounter other triangles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden platforms are your best friend. They will always get you to where you want to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, sometimes they need to be persuaded by a nearby button or lever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must you be confined to remaining a triangle? Certainly not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power to change your shape simply by picking up additional line segments or dropping ones you currently have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing your segment count will be useful as you travel across the land...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will you roll?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes of many sizes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures from scanned sheets of paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story to be told</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a triangle in a hand-drawn world. Roll around and encounter other triangles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden platforms are your best friend. They will always get you to where you want to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, sometimes they need to be persuaded by a nearby button or lever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must you be confined to remaining a triangle? Certainly not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power to change your shape simply by picking up additional line segments or dropping ones you currently have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing your segment count will be useful as you travel across the land...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will you roll?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes of many sizes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures from scanned sheets of paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story to be told</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Roll a triangle across a hand-drawn landscape. But sometimes, being a triangle isn't for the best which is why you can change your shape. This 2.5D puzzle platformer will take you through a variety of environments where you encounter other shapes, activate buttons, and flip levers.",
